                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Huyo Benaya ndiye yule aliyekuwa shujaa wa wale thelathini, na juu ya wale thelathini; na katika zamu yake alikuwa Amizabadi mwanawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
